  "description": "Han Ji-oh, the owner of an all-purpose neighborhood store, discovers a dimensional portal opened by a kitchen knife.\nThrough it, he begins traveling back and forth between the real world and another world.\nUsing a subspace, he starts doing business in both worlds, selling goods and making money.\nHis modest dream was simply to earn enough to become a building owner and live comfortably.\nBut then he gets dragged into a hero’s party and is told to stop the Demon King from being resurrected?! Thus begins Han Ji-oh’s dimension-hopping commercial action fantasy, as the owner of the Otherworldly General Store!",
